# Promotion: Second Lieutenant's area-3 5071 against ToAU 24 Foiled Ambition's area-3 handler (3097, Progress), in a
# GM-made state out of play order (the mission current by a GM): Chief Sergeant completed, AssaultPromotion 25. The
# missions' containers run before the quests'; equal ranks play the first container first, then rotate (an Event 5071
# would lose to 3097 every time). A full bag keeps 3097's finish from completing the mission (its five Imperial Gold
# Pieces do not fit). Area 3: 3097; again: 5071, finished: begun; again: 3097.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/onTriggerAreaEnter/3
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=37.024,-6.601,-62 job=WAR lvl=1
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionPrivateFirstClass completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionSuperiorPrivate completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionLanceCorporal completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionCorporal completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionSergeant completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionSergeantMajor completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionChiefSergeant completed
charvar AssaultPromotion 25
mission Toau FoiledAmbition current
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
fill-inventory
walk 37.024,-6.5,-56                    # area 3: 3097 and 5071 tie: 3097 (the missions first)
finish
walk 37.024,-6.601,-62
walk 37.024,-6.5,-56                    # rotation: 5071
finish                                  # begun
walk 37.024,-6.601,-62
walk 37.024,-6.5,-56                    # 3097 alone
finish
